# collisional_starburst_recipe with R4's flags, a minor merger burst (mode 0, ratio 0.1) whose
# recheck's wind energy is below the host's cold binding energy (no cold ejection) but above its CGM
# pair's alone (CGM or hot gas 0.001): the second test (M:411) adds the cold binding energy, so the
# host's CGM pair (its Regime 0) is kept.
# Built on burst_fire_host_central_satellite_differ's layout (a Type 1 host, galaxy 1; its FoF
# central, galaxy 0, the R3 Snap_32 row 4; an uninvolved orphan, galaxy 2), with R4's flags;
# constructed: the Regimes, the central's and host's pairs (the host's selected pair 0.001).
# Reachability: constructed routine-domain probe.
# R4's flags (par/R4.par): CGMrecipeOn 1 (:54), FIREmodeOn 1 (:55), SFprescription 1 (:48),
# BulgeSizeOn 3 (:109), SupernovaRecipeOn 1 (:50), DiskInstabilityOn 1 (:52), AGNrecipeOn 2 (:49);
# every other parameter R3's (R4.par differs from R3.par only at :7 and :54).
format sage26-oracle-fixture 1
routine collisional_starburst_recipe_fire

